        "id": 222599,
        "name": "bluedarky",
        "username": "bluedarky",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluedarky/{size}/1975_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-29T22:00:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Dr. Kaylo Epsilon\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Dr. Kaylo Epsilon:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n\t<b>bluedarky wrote:</b><br>\n\t<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><code>\t&lt;div class=\"bb-quote\"&gt;\n\t\t&lt;b&gt;Dr. Kaylo Epsilon wrote:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\n\t\t&lt;blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\"&gt;\n\t\t\tbluedark, are you saying the problem can't be fixed by adding player choice because there's currently no condition on either card that allows for player choice and there is no condition under which the replacement doesn't take effect? Or just that the loop exists because there's no condition under which the replacements don't take effect?\n</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><code>\t\t&lt;/blockquote&gt;\n\t&lt;/div&gt;\n</code></pre>\n<p>On the table that sort of solution is fine because we’re able to see the problem, the video game on the other hand is a different matter because of how it enforces card rulings, hence why certain cards have had to be rewritten for the video game,</p>\n<pre><code>&lt;/blockquote&gt;\n</code></pre>\n</blockquote></div>\n<p>You seem to have missed my question. Allow me to restate it. Ideally, your answer would start with “I meant A”, or “I meant B”, or “Neither, please let me clarify what I was saying”.<br><br>\nbluedark, are you saying&nbsp;</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A&gt; The problem can’t be fixed by adding player choice because there’s currently no condition on either card that allows for player choice and there is no condition under which the replacement doesn’t take effect? Or&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>B&gt; The loop exists because there’s no condition under which the replacements don’t take effect?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You are literally saying the same thing twice.</p>",
