        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-10-05T00:51:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Wording of Imbued Fire and Close Quarters is not the same as what Red Right Hand and Hippocratic Oath is. &nbsp;They say to change a damage type but don’t when ever X occurs do Y instead. &nbsp;The only way this loop is broken is if all hero targets are already at full health. &nbsp;</p>",
