        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/ec9cab/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-10-05T00:54:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Order of Activation would still apply though regardless of anything else.</p>\n<p>https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/timing-and-order-of-operations-4347</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>now granted in most game played, people will use Shield Winds before the -1 DR in tempest deck, when taking 5 damage so you can apply both, but if the damage is like 8 you can only apply shielding wind once, can't bounce back to that card once you apply the card affect. All I am saying, is apply the card once. That is the rule intention.</p>",
